<title>ITALY: Italian bonds/futures end firmer,awaiting rate cut.</title>
<headline>Italian bonds/futures end firmer,awaiting rate cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>1515 GMT - Italian bonds and Btp futures ended firmer but off session highs after made little movement in the afternoon.</p>
<p>Market shrugging off easier performance in T-Bonds and bunds and is awaiting Bank of Italy interest rate cut, traders said. Little interest seen in cash market.</p>
<p>* Bonds:Feb 07 +22bps at 96.34, yield 7.40, bund spread 163bps</p>
<p>* Futures:JunLIF +37bps at 129.20. Res 129.60, sup 129.00</p>
<p>* Lira:steady vs mark at 989.00/9.30</p>
</text>
